Ben burada ciddi konuşuyorum!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Why are you talking about old dudes
so much?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I get it.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} You think old dudes are
awesome. Enough already!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Pourquoi tu passes ton temps à
parler d'pépés ?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Que tu trouves les vieux extra, tant
mieux.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Mais on a compris, quoi !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Neden sürekli yaşlı adamlardan
bahsediyorsun?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Tamam, anladım.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Yaşlı adamları
acayip havalı buluyorsun. Yeter artık!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Oh, I see.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I thought maybe you were
trying to figure out if you could be
an old guy too, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¡¿Qué he dicho?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Si lo de ser
adulto mola muchísimo! ¡Y hasta te
podrás casar conmigo, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Oh, je vois.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} J'ai cru que tu te
demandais si toi aussi tu deviendrais
un pépé un jour, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ha, anladım.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bir an sen de yaşlı bir
adam olabilir misin diye düşünüyorsun
sandım, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Stop making everything about the
almighty {{TAG:0005:000F:0000}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I get it! You're obsessed with the
almighty {{TAG:0005:000F:0000}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Smettila! Cambia argomento!
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0000}}
di qui, di lì, di su, di giù!
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ho capito! Sei ossessionato!
